WEBVTT

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:12.580
It's not here either.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:14.450
We may not be able to find it.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.160
Calm down.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.790
I know just what to do.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.700
Yes, this is New Compton waste disposal.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:28.830
Hello.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:33.620
I accidentally put something
really important in the garbage,

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:36.080
and it just got picked up.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.370
I'm sorry to hear that.

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:39.160
Goodbye.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.200
W-Wait!

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.660
Is there something else?

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.080
I told you, it's really important!

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:50.330
When your garbage is picked up,
you lose all rights to it.

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:51.200
Goodbye.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.410
Wait, I said...

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.660
Um, uh... I know!

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.790
It's important evidence.

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:01.080
I'm Cecil Epps, with the
San-Teresa Metropolitan Police.

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.790
I'm a deputy coroner.

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:08.620
Um... if this evidence is lost,
th-the investigation will...

00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:13.120
Um... something really bad will happen to it!
So cooperate with the police investigation!

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.040
Please, grant me mercy!

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:56.950
Grant me salvation!

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:59.660
O'Neill, I came here to ask you something!

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.500
Look at this. It's the tip you gave me.

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:06.790
I need to know more about the guy
you said is working with the smuggler...

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:09.950
The patient is in pain. Stop it.

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.910
It's just a hangover.

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:13.330
Hey! Look at this!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:16.660
Is this the guy who you saw with the smuggler?

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:21.450
If I tell you, will I be able to go to heaven?

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.120
In first class?

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:27.790
Yeah. With all the expensive wine
and cognac you can drink!

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.580
I never want to drink another drop of alcohol!

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.790
Answer me, you hungover asshole!

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:34.950
Detective!

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:38.410
He's hyperventilating!

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:39.540
Mr. O'Neill!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:42.750
Calm down, Mr. O'Neill! Everything will be fine!

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:45.330
Shit.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.000
He's gone.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:53.290
Kenny, do you know the girl O'Neill
went on a date with a few days ago?

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:57.000
She may have seen the smuggler.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.500
That would be the SM queen you just saw.

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.080
The one in the kitchen.

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:05.160
She had her head stuck in the fridge, right?

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:06.330
Did she?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.370
My name is Cecil Epps.

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:11.910
Well, it looks real to me.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.620
Not that I've never seen one.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:17.540
So, what's your address, Miss Epps?

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:21.700
172 Caster Street.

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:26.290
Hunter Waste Management handles that area, so...

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:29.620
It's truck number 3. Right over there.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.620
In front of the WCT.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.540
WCT?

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.750
The waste disposal terminal.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.700
Everything we collect is dumped in there.

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.410
Oh, no!

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:43.660
Wait! Stop! Stop!

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:53.950
Stop it! Stop it!

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:54.950
What?

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:56.160
Oh, jeez!

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.450
Tilarna?

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:08.330
Chief, it's me. Matoba.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:11.200
About Hellmandes with the CBP...

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.200
I just got another call from the man.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.330
So you did get in a fight with him.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.290
Just now?

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:20.870
Something about you not picking up the phone,
and whether or not you were at home.

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:23.620
Hey, are you listening, Matoba?

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:25.870
Which means...

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:28.910
Sorry, Chief! I'll call you back!

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:34.700
Cecil?

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:38.250
I'm sorry, Kei...

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.580
We need to talk about Tilarna...

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:41.660
What happened?

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:49.830
So Tilarna and Kuroi switched bodies?

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:52.910
Okay. Magic, huh? I believe it.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:58.750
So right now it's Tilarna,
or rather Kuroi, who's at my house?

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.790
--That's dangerous.
--Dangerous?

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:04.330
I need to hurry. Cecil, I'll call you back.

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:06.040
Wait, Kei!

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:10.160
Kuroi's body, here at the dump, is...

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:13.870
I tried to stop her, but...

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.750
Don't worry about that.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:20.410
It's Tilarna, right? So I'm sure she's fine.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:21.410
Bye.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:23.410
I found it. There's the cat!

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:27.660
Tilarna!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:31.790
Smell it. The smell of latena.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.200
Don't use your nose. Use your heart.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:42.620
There it is!

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:11.750
It's over...

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:28.830
Damn it...

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:34.500
Give me the damn crossbow!

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:37.000
My life is on the line here!

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:40.660
This is...

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:43.330
Thank you, God!

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:46.330
Thank you, God! Thank you, God!

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:50.410
You can't get out of this
by pretending you're crazy--

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.370
Don't touch me.

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:52.370
What?

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.040
You saw, didn't you?

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.370
Saw what?

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:04.660
I don't know what's going on here,
but you're in for a world of pain!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.500
--D-Don't hurt me!
--Shut up!

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:13.200
--I just wanted to make some money...
--I don't care!

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:16.950
Mercy!

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:18.370
No mercy!

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:27.250
Please don't...

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:34.830
You're going to die like a bug,
with no dignity at all...

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.750
Curses of Beyadah upon you!

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:40.080
Hey, don't kill him!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.370
That's you, right, Tilarna?

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.580
You're back?

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.290
Kei?

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:54.040
My life... my life...

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.620
What a mess.

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.160
Clean this up.

00:08:57.160 --> 00:09:00.910
That weird crossbow only activated
because you were careless, right?

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:02.040
Shut up!

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.200
What's wrong with you?

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:06.410
This morning I was trying
my best to get your help,

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.870
and you left without figuring out a thing!

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:12.700
How was I supposed to know
you'd swapped bodies with Kuroi?

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:14.120
B-But...

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:19.540
Having you all over me dressed like that
first thing in the morning was freaking me out.

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:21.580
I wanted to get out of there.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:24.580
It was freaking you out?

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:25.790
Huh?

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.580
No, nothing...

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.660
So what happened to the crossbow?

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:34.540
It was destroyed.
That's why I was able to go back, I think.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:37.620
There's no way to know now, though.

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.040
I guess that's just how it goes.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:41.120
I need to get better control of myself.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:44.160
And thanks to you,
I didn't even get to kill that man.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:46.620
If you did, it would be mur--

00:09:46.620 --> 00:09:48.160
Wait...

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:52.000
Did he do something to you?

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.200
No! He definitely did not! Not a chance!

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.950
He just saw me!

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:57.870
Saw you?

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:01.200
I-It's very important...

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.700
What a pain.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.290
What's a pain?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.040
Aren't you mad?

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.080
He saw my butt...

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:11.000
No... Anyway, you should be madder!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.290
Why would I?

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:15.950
Shut up! Get a little mad, you rakebye!

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:17.830
Wait a second.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:19.870
I think I forgot something.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:22.450
Don't try and change the subject--

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:26.160
Where are Kuroi and Cecil?

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:28.950
I'm sorry, Tilarna...

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:32.410
I couldn't help you!

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:38.950
Tilarna!

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.620
Tilarna, I'm sorry!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.870
I couldn't help you!

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.870
I don't know what to say to you!

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:04.660
Fifteen years ago, a hyperspace gate
appeared in the middle of the Pacific.

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:10.000
Beyond the gate lay a strange world
filled with fairies and monsters.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:12.290
Kariaena Island. The city of San-Teresa.

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:15.410
This city is Earth's "front door."

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:18.080
Over two million citizens
from both worlds live here.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:22.450
A mixture of different races and
diverse cultures, haves and have-nots...

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:26.120
The world's newest "city of dreams."

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:30.370
But in the shadows of all this
chaos lurked countless crimes.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.120
Drugs. Prostitution.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.450
Weapons smuggling.

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:36.410
The San-Teresa Metropolitan Police maintained

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:39.410
a special unit to deal with these crimes.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.950
I think you overcooked it.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:55.450
Matoba, are you insulting
the Zimmer family recipe?

00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:57.370
You're just burning it.

00:11:57.370 --> 00:12:01.370
Put it on a tray, lower the heat,
and close the grill.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:04.120
You need to get that hot air flowing over it.

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:06.910
The meat looked so good, too.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:08.950
Shut up!

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:12.450
Whenever you talk about food
or cars, you get all obsessed...

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:14.450
You sound like a food snob!

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:16.080
I'm not a snob!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:18.160
Every snob says that!

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:19.750
And anyway, this is my home.

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:22.250
This food is under my jurisdiction!

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:25.910
Now quit bitching, go to the kitchen,
and get me a beer!

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:30.410
I'm the one who brought the meat
you're ruining, and it was expensive!

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:33.540
Kei, you want to join us?
The water feels great!

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:35.120
Later.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.330
That's a shame.

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:40.370
Ignore him.
He's pretending to be too cool for it.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:49.500
What's wrong? What's wrong? What's wrong?

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.700
Come on, tell your daddy!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.000
Who took the towel off?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.370
Me. Was that a problem?

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:01.950
I was using it as a cover.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:05.750
You need to make it dark,
or the clams won't spit out the salt.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:08.040
They spit out the sand already, right?

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:09.950
But not the salt.

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:11.950
Who cares? It's not a big deal.

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:13.160
It is a big deal!

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.580
These clams are filled with salt water.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.910
You need them to spit it out
or you can't eat them.

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:21.830
At least... don't put much salt in.

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:23.790
Or actually, don't put any in.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:29.500
You always get really annoying
about cooking, Kei.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.410
You really seem like a food snob.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.700
I don't want my son to end up like you.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.660
I'm not a snob.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.830
All snobs say that.

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:43.330
San-Teresa City. San-Teresa City...

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:44.750
The mayoral election?

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:47.950
It's a farce. There's nobody worth voting for.

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:51.700
This Kahns guy is the best of the bunch.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.620
Nathan Kahns.

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:58.910
He was mayor of Seattle for two terms.
City councilman here for two years.

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:02.620
He looks like a guy who no girl
wants to date even though he's rich.

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:03.500
Maybe,

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:06.540
but he's had a lot of mayoral experience
and knows what he's talking about.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:08.660
And he's a lot better than the other two.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:11.120
My wife and I are voting for this Kahns guy.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:16.290
Mozeleemay is running too, huh?

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.540
Yeah.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:21.160
I still can't believe that
guy's running for mayor.

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:26.830
There's also the far-right candidate Tourte,
who says the aliens should go back into space.

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:27.830
What?

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:30.870
Breaking news!

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:34.160
--Mayoral candidate Kahns has just been shot!
--Kahns was shot?

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:36.910
Look over there!
They just loaded him into an ambulance.

00:14:36.910 --> 00:14:40.000
He's not responding to anything
his team says to him...

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.750
Oh, God... I can't believe this is happening.

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:46.410
Oh, God! Oh, God!

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:48.910
The meat's done, Matoba.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.160
Now where's that beer?

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.080
What's wrong?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.790
The news is saying...

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.330
We're having an emergency briefing.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:07.540
A candidate for mayor was shot.

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:14.000
The shooter is John Ennaji.

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:15.660
A male Semanian.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:18.080
32 in Earth years.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.120
Single, works at a convenience store.

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:23.620
No criminal record except
for a few speeding tickets.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:26.580
Everybody who knows him
says they can't believe it.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:29.250
No underworld connections, either.

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:33.580
There's no role for the
Special Vice Squad here, but...

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:35.450
Is there a problem?

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:39.290
I read your report. About Rick Fury.

00:15:49.750 --> 00:15:51.330
Zelada?

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:53.250
We never found his body.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:57.830
It wouldn't surprise me at all
if he was still alive.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:00.750
So is this what you're saying, Chief?

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:04.450
The shooter who killed Kahns
was controlled with magic?

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:06.370
Don't just come out and say it.

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:08.830
We're just covering all the bases. Got it?

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:13.120
I want you and Exedilica to head to
the coroner's office and see what you find, now.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:15.700
Now? Dressed like this?

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.540
Yeah. Now.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:24.330
I thought it might have been
another controlled corpse, too.

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:27.290
I didn't expect Inspector Zimmer
would pick up on it, though.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:31.120
He surprises you with
how smart he is sometimes.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:33.660
I just wanted to go home.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:38.540
You don't want to catch the guy
who was behind Kahns' death?

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:44.000
I don't want to waste a valuable
weekend avenging a politician.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:44.950
Kei...

00:16:44.950 --> 00:16:46.580
I was kidding.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:51.290
I've found myself impressed
by Earth's democracy.

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:56.000
I think a system that reflects the people's
wishes in any way at all is a wonderful thing.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:17:01.200
And this shooting is a declaration
of war against that system.

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:05.160
That's a nice speech. Or it would be
if you weren't wearing a swimsuit.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:08.790
Stop staring.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.370
That's why I didn't want to do this.

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:15.370
I don't understand... Are they mocking us?

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:16.830
Forget it.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:25.580
You in there, Cecil? I'm coming in.

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:27.950
Kei? Wait!

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:29.250
Who are you?

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:33.370
We'll be quick.

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:35.660
Man, it sure is hot today.

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:38.910
The chief was right.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:45.750
He was dead, and someone manipulated
his body into doing the murder.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.040
Zelada?

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.450
I can't be sure.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:53.250
But this form of magic is particularly rare.

00:17:58.370 --> 00:17:59.830
What do we do now?

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:01.910
We tell Chief Zimmer first.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:07.290
Damn alien.

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:10.540
Hold up.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:13.200
What did you just say?

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:14.200
Nothing.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:15.700
Don't lie to me.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:19.000
What did you just say when you saw her?

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:20.330
I don't know...

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:21.830
I heard it.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:24.870
You called her a "damn alien."

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:27.410
You insulted my partner.

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.500
What made you think that was a good idea?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:34.700
Officer Sanders...
Sanders, Sanders, Officer Sanders...

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:36.870
You want to tell me why you said that?

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:37.910
I'm sorry.

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:39.540
I asked you a question.

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:41.040
Um, please...

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:42.580
Kei, that's enough.

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:46.290
Officer Sanders, I told you
to answer my question.

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:47.120
Now, do it!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:48.700
Please!

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:50.540
Please forgive me...

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:55.200
My family is conservative.
We were voting for Kahns...

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:58.870
And, um... after what happened today...

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:03.620
The killer was... from the other world...

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:06.290
So you think she killed Kahns, then.

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:07.250
No.

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:10.410
Then she killed your family, then.

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:11.330
No.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:15.500
Christ. Do you have a reason
to insult her, then?

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.040
Who the hell do you think you are?

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:19.580
Do you act like this towards the citizens, too?

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:20.580
Kei.

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:25.200
That's enough. Let's go.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:26.410
But...

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.290
It's fine. Let's go.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.120
That was embarrassing.

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:05.580
I wish you wouldn't do that.

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:07.330
Sorry.

00:20:07.330 --> 00:20:09.750
But thank you.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.790
I didn't do it because I wanted a thank you.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:15.450
He just made me mad.

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:17.500
I thought you'd say that.

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:22.540
You call people "aliens" all the time, anyway.

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:25.080
When I do, it's...

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:26.870
It's like a joke.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:32.160
It's like when a gangster calls his
girlfriend a bitch trying to look cool.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:36.450
But if somebody else calls her a bitch,
he gets mad. It's like that.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.910
I'm not your woman.

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:47.450
Of course not. It was an example. Sheesh.

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:48.950
Just forget it.

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:52.540
Okay, I'll let you off the hook for now.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:54.830
Thank me later, doreany.

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.000
Quiet, alien.

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:00.200
I see.

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:02.330
It's probably Zelada.

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:05.200
Inspector Zimmer, you were right.

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:06.580
That's a shame.

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:08.330
I was hoping I wasn't.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.290
Why?

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:15.790
Because now I get to go to every
department involved and tell them,

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.660
"Watch out for wizards."

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:20.120
That's rough.

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:24.790
A Semanian shot an Earth mayoral candidate.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:27.160
This is going to be a pain.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:28.950
How?

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:30.830
Ethnic strife.

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:32.580
Just like you saw earlier.

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:33.950
You know what I mean, right?

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:39.290
Even if Zelada, a Semanian, is behind it,

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:43.200
we need to figure out the truth
as fast as possible.

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:46.500
But how do we find the guy?

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:52.450
It's not like you can catch
a wizard on a security camera.

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:56.500
How about we go back to
the basics of investigating?

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.160
What do you mean by basics?

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:00.790
Motive.

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:03.830
Who gains by Kahns' death?

00:23:42.660 --> 00:23:44.450
"Next time"
Next time on <i>COP CRAFT</i>.
